<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman ups Volkswagen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman ups Volkswagen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers raised its price target for Volkswagen AG to 800 marks from 700, a research note from analyst Chris Will at the brokerage said on Friday.</p>
<p>The stock was up 15.50 marks at 706.00 marks by 1059 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
